1)Purpose of project:

Read the given image from source folder and do following modification on that image:
Part1:
Remove lower left quadrant of the image and show the output.
Part2:
Decrease size of image from 256*256 to 128*128 by removing every other pixel.


2)Name of source code file:

    PixelArrangement.c

3)Name of executable file:

    makefile

4)How to run the program:

  type 'make' in command prompt.It will create object file of name output.
  After that type './output' to run the program.

